    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a search that terminated after finding a clobber. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This clobber may or may not be present in the path of defs from LastNode..SearchStart, since it may have been retrieved from cache. </para>
